- Incubation: 37 C / 5% CO2, standard polystyrene lid, plate at the front of the top shelf; the humidity tray of that incubator was found dry when the plate was taken out.
- Fixation 4% PFA, permeabilisation 0.1% Triton X-100.
- Staining: Alexa Fluor 488 conjugate against the marker protein, added by hand with an 8-channel pipette column by column from column 1 to column 12; the stain was removed from the whole plate at once with the plate washer 45 min after the first column had been filled. Two PBS washes, wells left in 100 uL PBS.
